    {
      "text": "1) Hardware: To demonstrate that our approach can extend",
      "bbox": [
        58.927001953125,
        511.6563720703125,
        300.0264587402344,
        520.5629272460938
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "to more complex, high-dimensional systems, we use PAC-",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        523.611328125,
        300.0215148925781,
        532.5178833007812
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "NMPC to control a 24” wingspan Edge 540 fixed-wing UAV. It",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        535.5673828125,
        300.0214538574219,
        544.4739379882812
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "has a controllable propeller, rudder, elevator, and kinematically",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        547.5223388671875,
        300.021484375,
        556.4288940429688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "linked ailerons. The position and orientation are tracked with",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        559.4773559570312,
        300.021484375,
        568.3839111328125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "an OptiTrack system.",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        571.432373046875,
        136.10684204101562,
        580.3389282226562
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "2) Setup: We utilize a quaternion formulation of the fixed-",
      "bbox": [
        58.927005767822266,
        583.7113647460938,
        300.02032470703125,
        592.617919921875
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "wing described in [2] with RK2 integration. This system has a",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        595.6663818359375,
        300.02154541015625,
        604.5729370117188
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "17-dimensional state space and a 4-dimensional control space.",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        607.621337890625,
        300.0215148925781,
        616.5278930664062
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The state of the system is x = [r, q, δ, v, ω, p] where r ∈R3",
      "bbox": [
        48.96400451660156,
        617.8761596679688,
        299.5280456542969,
        628.48291015625
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "is the position, q ∈Q is the orientation, δ ∈R3 are control",
      "bbox": [
        48.96397399902344,
        627.9163818359375,
        300.02581787109375,
        640.4389038085938
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "surface deflections of the ailerons, elevator, and rudder respec-",
      "bbox": [
        48.96397399902344,
        643.4873657226562,
        300.021484375,
        652.3939208984375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "tively, v ∈R3 is the linear velocity, ω ∈R3 is the angular",
      "bbox": [
        48.96397399902344,
        651.827392578125,
        300.0223083496094,
        664.3489379882812
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "velocity, and p is the propeller speed. The control signal is",
      "bbox": [
        48.9639892578125,
        667.2379150390625,
        300.02642822265625,
        676.3038940429688
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the rate of change of the control surface deflections and of",
      "bbox": [
        48.9639892578125,
        679.3523559570312,
        300.02154541015625,
        688.2589111328125
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "the propeller speed: u = [ua, ue, ur, up]. We place noise",
      "bbox": [
        48.9639892578125,
        691.14794921875,
        300.01788330078125,
        700.909912109375
      ],
      "direction": [
        1.0,
        0.0
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "represented by a 3 component Gaussian Mixture Model over",
      "bbox": [
